{
  "info": {
    "name": "Rescata - Donations (Entrega 2)",
    "description": "Pruebas de la Entrega del microservicio Donations, ahora con autenticación.\n\nDonations exige un JWT emitido por Identity en todas sus peticiones. Ejecute primero «0. Login en Identity (negocio)»: guarda el token en la variable accessToken y el resto de peticiones lo heredan por la autenticación de la colección.\n\nCrear, actualizar y cancelar exigen el rol Business o Admin. Listar y consultar el detalle aceptan cualquier usuario autenticado, así que el token de negocio cubre los diez escenarios.\n\nIdentity corre en el puerto 5223 y Donations en el 5001.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Fechas relativas al momento de ejecutar, equivalentes a {{$datetime}} del archivo .http.",
          "const ahora = Date.now();",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"availableUntilFuture\", new Date(ahora + 2 * 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString());",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"availableUntilPast\", new Date(ahora - 60 * 60 * 1000).toISOString());"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "identityHost",
      "value": "http://localhost:5223",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "donationsHost",
      "value": "http://localhost:5001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "businessEmail",
      "value": "business.test@rescata.local",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "businessPassword",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "categoriaPanaderia",
      "value": "01A10DE6-C9D7-7B3D-A70D-4898E8C0A082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "negocio",
      "value": "2c1f7c1e-5a7b-4e8a-9a3b-1d2e3f4a5b6c",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "availableUntilFuture",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "availableUntilPast",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Login en Identity (negocio)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Login correcto (200)\", function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
              "    const token = pm.response.json().data.accessToken;",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", token);",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{businessEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{businessPassword}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{identityHost}}/api/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{identityHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Ejecute esta petición primero. Guarda el accessToken en la variable de colección accessToken, que las demás peticiones envían como Bearer. Sin este paso, Donations responde 401 en todas.\n\nAntes de ejecutarla, llene businessPassword en las variables de la colección."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Crear donación válida",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessId\": \"{{negocio}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Pan del día\",\n  \"description\": \"20 kg de pan francés horneado hoy, en buen estado.\",\n  \"quantityAmount\": 20,\n  \"quantityUnit\": \"Kilogramos\",\n  \"foodCategoryId\": \"{{categoriaPanaderia}}\",\n  \"pickupAddress\": {\n    \"roadType\": \"Calle\",\n    \"roadNumber\": \"10\",\n    \"crossRoadNumber\": \"43A\",\n    \"plateNumber\": \"25\",\n    \"roadSuffix\": \"Sur\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellín\"\n  },\n  \"availableUntil\": \"{{availableUntilFuture}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 201 Created con el id. Exige rol Business o Admin."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Cantidad 0",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessId\": \"{{negocio}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Pan del día\",\n  \"description\": \"Pan francés\",\n  \"quantityAmount\": 0,\n  \"quantityUnit\": \"Kilogramos\",\n  \"foodCategoryId\": \"{{categoriaPanaderia}}\",\n  \"pickupAddress\": {\n    \"roadType\": \"Calle\",\n    \"roadNumber\": \"10\",\n    \"crossRoadNumber\": \"43A\",\n    \"plateNumber\": \"25\",\n    \"roadSuffix\": \"Sur\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellín\"\n  },\n  \"availableUntil\": \"{{availableUntilFuture}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 400 - La cantidad debe ser mayor a cero."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Hora límite en el pasado",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessId\": \"{{negocio}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Pan del día\",\n  \"description\": \"Pan francés\",\n  \"quantityAmount\": 20,\n  \"quantityUnit\": \"Kilogramos\",\n  \"foodCategoryId\": \"{{categoriaPanaderia}}\",\n  \"pickupAddress\": {\n    \"roadType\": \"Calle\",\n    \"roadNumber\": \"10\",\n    \"crossRoadNumber\": \"43A\",\n    \"plateNumber\": \"25\",\n    \"roadSuffix\": \"Sur\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellín\"\n  },\n  \"availableUntil\": \"{{availableUntilPast}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 400 - regla R5."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Título de 2 caracteres",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessId\": \"{{negocio}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Pa\",\n  \"description\": \"Pan francés\",\n  \"quantityAmount\": 20,\n  \"quantityUnit\": \"Kilogramos\",\n  \"foodCategoryId\": \"{{categoriaPanaderia}}\",\n  \"pickupAddress\": {\n    \"roadType\": \"Calle\",\n    \"roadNumber\": \"10\",\n    \"crossRoadNumber\": \"43A\",\n    \"plateNumber\": \"25\",\n    \"roadSuffix\": \"Sur\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellín\"\n  },\n  \"availableUntil\": \"{{availableUntilFuture}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 400 - regla R2."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Categoría que no existe",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessId\": \"{{negocio}}\",\n  \"title\": \"Pan del día\",\n  \"description\": \"Pan francés\",\n  \"quantityAmount\": 20,\n  \"quantityUnit\": \"Kilogramos\",\n  \"foodCategoryId\": \"11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111\",\n  \"pickupAddress\": {\n    \"roadType\": \"Calle\",\n    \"roadNumber\": \"10\",\n    \"crossRoadNumber\": \"43A\",\n    \"plateNumber\": \"25\",\n    \"roadSuffix\": \"Sur\",\n    \"city\": \"Medellín\"\n  },\n  \"availableUntil\": \"{{availableUntilFuture}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 404 - La categoría del alimento no existe."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Listado paginado",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "pageNumber",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "key": "pageSize",
              "value": "10"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 con items, totalCount y pageNumber. Acepta cualquier usuario autenticado."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Listado filtrado por estado Available",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&status=Available",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "pageNumber",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "key": "pageSize",
              "value": "10"
            },
            {
              "key": "status",
              "value": "Available"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 solo con donaciones disponibles."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Listado filtrado por categoría",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations?foodCategoryId={{categoriaPanaderia}}",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations"
          ],
          "query": [
            {
              "key": "foodCategoryId",
              "value": "{{categoriaPanaderia}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 solo con donaciones de esa categoría."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Detalle por Id existente",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations/01A10DE6-C9D7-7B3D-A70D-4898E8C0A082",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations",
            "01A10DE6-C9D7-7B3D-A70D-4898E8C0A082"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 200 con el detalle. Reemplace el Id por uno devuelto en el POST o en el listado."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Detalle por Id inexistente",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{donationsHost}}/api/donations/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
          "host": [
            "{{donationsHost}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "donations",
            "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Esperado: 404 - No existe una donación con el Id indicado."
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}
